<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa money mkt shortage at 8.975 bln rand Mon.</title>
<headline>S.Africa money mkt shortage at 8.975 bln rand Mon.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Reserve Bank said the money market shortage rose to 8.975 billion rand on Monday after easing slightly to 8.555 billion rand on Saturday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
